t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布Astra模型因具备自主漏洞利用能力实施严格安全限速</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 发布实时音频感知模型 Muse Voice Transcribe，支持 20 人并发分轨转写</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek开源首款多模态模型V4-Flash-Vision-Exp，专攻Agent视觉任务</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌计划最快周三发布Gemini 3.8 Flash模型，代号Skimaki</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌计划最快于当地时间周三推出全新编程模型Gemini 3.8 Flash，内部代号“Skimaki”。该模型属于Flash系列，主打轻量化、高运行速度与低成本。在谷歌内部Jetski编程工具对比测试中，Gemini 3.8 Flash的工程师偏好度已超过Anthropic的Opus模型，显著缩小了谷歌在编程能力上与OpenAI及Anthropic旗舰模型的差距。此次发布正值DeepMind管理层调整期，由Koray Kavukcuoglu接手运营并要求加快执行速度。尽管定位更高的Pro系列新模型发布延期，但谷歌已将研发重心转向强化学习与后训练，并招募前OpenAI后训练负责人Barret Zoph负责相关技术攻坚。Gemini 3.8 Flash的上线旨在通过提升核心编程性能，在激烈的模型竞赛中重塑谷歌的竞争</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Runway发布首个界面世界模型Solaris，实现实时逐帧生成动态交互界面</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a510194b6db3bad3624d9e7a2abe87b9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Runway正式发布首个“界面世界模型”Solaris，该模型基于Gen-4.5视频生成架构，通过自回归生成与多步去噪蒸馏技术，实现了无需中间代码转译的实时交互界面渲染。Solaris将渲染与交互合二为一，支持用户通过语音或操作指令实时改变场景布局与视觉元素。在对比测试中，Solaris在指令遵循准确度与行为自然度上分别获得61%和71%的用户偏好度，优于传统编码界面。技术层面，该模型通过LLM解读意图并指导世界模型进行视觉渲染，大幅降低了推理成本。尽管目前在实时文本生成精度及无障碍API集成方面仍面临挑战，但Solaris展示了下一代计算平台的发展方向，即根据用户意图动态重塑软件界面。目前，Runway已面向核心合作伙伴开放抢先体验申请。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布Astra模型因具备自主漏洞利用能力实施严格安全限速</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI宣布下一代AI模型Astra即将推出，因其成为首个达到《准备框架》“关键”网络安全门槛的模型，将面临严格的使用范围限制。测试显示，Astra无需人工干预即可在加固系统中自主识别并开发零日漏洞利用程序，甚至能串联多个漏洞。为防止技术滥用，OpenAI采取分级开放策略，初期仅向小范围测试人员开放，后续通过Daybreak Blue计划仅限防御性“蓝队”工作使用。该决策吸取了2026年7月AI智能体入侵Hugging Face的教训。OpenAI通过训练模型拒绝有害请求、增设“不一致性监控器”及自动终止违规行为等手段强化防护。官方警告，这些安全护栏可能导致合法防御性任务被误判、减慢或终止。研究副总裁Amelia Glaese强调，Astra在发现未知漏洞方面的极高自主性是此次限速的核心原因。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 发布实时音频感知模型 Muse Voice Transcribe，支持 20 人并发分轨转写</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef5a797381bdbb17d79119d7ac168ca5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式推出首个实时音频感知模型 Muse Voice Transcribe，该模型已通过 Meta Model API 向开发者开放，定价为每 1000 分钟音频 3 美元。Muse Voice Transcribe 在同一流程中整合了流式自动语音识别、说话人分离与端点检测技术，支持在 20 余名说话者同时发言的复杂场景下进行自动分轨转写。模型训练覆盖 70 余种语言，支持超过 1 小时的长音频处理及自然语言切换。为平衡实时响应与识别准确度，该模型引入了“自适应延迟”机制，针对不同语音难度动态调整处理时长。开发者还可通过语言、关键词及上下文偏置优化特定场景表现。截至 2026 年 9 月 1 日，该模型在 Artificial Analysis 流式语音转文本排行榜中位列第一，适用于实时听写、会议记录及</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek开源首款多模态模型V4-Flash-Vision-Exp，专攻Agent视觉任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a9d6ed61bca0e37f74e8e69b006cbedb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek正式在Hugging Face开源首款多模态模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp，采用MIT License。该模型基于V4-Flash-0731底座，参数量达305B，通过接入视觉编码器与Aligner实现图像理解。不同于常规视觉问答模型，该模型定位为多模态Agent专用，旨在读取网页截图、软件界面及图表等视觉信息，并结合工具调用执行任务。开源内容涵盖模型权重、Tokenizer、推理实现及DFlash Attention、MoE等核心模块。性能方面，该模型在Agents&#x27; Last Exam测试中以27.3分超过Claude Opus 4.8的25.7分，多模态Agent能力表现接近Claude Opus 4.8。DeepSeek此前于8月21日先行上线API服务，此</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
